  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Choked Out**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Song for My Stepfather**: back after 45 archived shows (980 days); rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Mourn Not The Dead**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Rain in Soho**: back after 44 archived shows (965 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2022-05-20.SBDMatrix** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 121 min [1]. Said about its sound: Iz0tope was used to remove clicks from loud claps and to attenuate audience noise spectrally; final files are FLAC 24-bit 48kHz [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taping was permitted by First Avenue and the Mountain Goats, with help from Ryan Matteson and Brandon Eggleston [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2022-05-20.SBDMatrix**: taped by roffels; source: Soundboard Nakamichi CM 300 matrix [1]. Also: Recorded with Nakamichi CM-300 cardioid microphones into a Roland R07 at 96kHz/24-bit, with tracks synced in Vegas 14 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by First Avenue: [the Mountain Goats ★ First Avenue - First Avenue](https://first-avenue.com/event/2022-05-the-mountain-goats/) [4]",
